<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria 1996 producer prices rise 357 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria 1996 producer prices rise 357 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's producer price inflation was 356.7 percent last year against 38.9 in 1995, National Statistics Institute (NSI) figures show.</p>
<p> BULGARIAN PRODUCER PRICES    DEC	  NOV	 DEC'95</p>
<p> monthly pct change	    +32.0	+10.7	 +4.5</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change	     +356.7     +257.1	+38.9</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
